{"completed": true, "response": "那种熟悉的满足感再次变得更充实，喜悦也比之前更强烈、更深沉，让他更加沉醉，也更加急切。之前的亲近确实给了他温暖，但他心里仍然顾虑着要不要表露自己的心意。越是明白这份亲近对自己有多重要，越是觉得眼前的温暖真实可贵，他就越想让这份亲近维持得久一些，甚至还没失去，就已经开始舍不得。他一度很想彻底表达自己的心意，几乎就要坦然承认，可越是接近表露心意的那一步，之前的顾虑就越让他退缩，使他再次收住了自己。强烈的喜悦渐渐平息，但不舍仍留在心里，和亲近带来的满足、尚未解开的纠结一起，慢慢沉入平静之中。", "metadata": {"session_handle": "74eed3e7-d596-41a2-99cc-a1e3a6987efc", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T004427718205Z", "elapsed_seconds": 9.469, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T00:44:37.191780+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "43f6ba81b4049006bd8940c84e06c7e6e2bf2f27ea1ccae2b73b49b1b07041b9", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge